OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,6,     F4/5. Donald Macleod delves into a
OL,7,     Fperiod when Samuel Barber starts
OL,8,     Flooking to old compositions as
OL,9,     Finspiration for new ones.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FCellists Christopher Allan, Adrian
OL,12,     FBradbury, Ian Burdge, and Ben
OL,13,     FRogerson - Cellophonics - perform
OL,14,     Flive, and Trevor Herbert discusses
OL,15,     Fhis new book The Brass Band Story.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FThe third in this week's series of
OL,18,     Ffour Classical Mixtapes featuring
OL,19,     Fmusic in this year's BBC Proms,
OL,20,     Fincluding music by Messiaen,
OL,21,     FHildegard of Bingen, Prokofiev,
OL,22,     Fand Mahler.
